  "goodToKnow": "Hausen means to live somewhere, usually in poor or cramped conditions: in einer Baracke hausen. The neutral word is wohnen. It also means to wreak havoc: Die Einbrecher haben in der Wohnung gehaust wie die Vandalen. In Austria and Bavaria, hausen can also mean to keep house thriftily. From das Haus. Regular: hauste, gehaust."
